      "side": 1,
      "message": "In the next CL in the stack (https://crrev.com/c/8607950), [`zephyr_print()`](https://source.chromium.org/chromiumos/chromiumos/codesearch/+/main:src/platform/ec/zephyr/shim/src/console.c;l\u003d539-580;drc\u003d686b61c7c2fa3f6706c02a53762ba25f0bf69745) adds:\n```c\nif (shell_stopped || !shell_is_active() || !k_can_yield()) {\n\tif (!IS_ENABLED(CONFIG_LOG_MODE_MINIMAL) \u0026\u0026\n\t    IS_ENABLED(CONFIG_PLATFORM_EC_HOSTCMD_CONSOLE)) {\n\t\tconsole_buf_notify_chars(buff, size);\n\t}\n\tprintk_unlocked(\"%s\", buff);\n\treturn;\n}\n```\nAnd in https://crrev.com/c/8607951 (`log_backend_cros_ec.c`), the `!k_can_yield()` path holds `k_spin_lock(\u0026isr_log_lock)` while calling `flush_line_buf()` -\u003e `zephyr_print()`.\n\nBecause [`console_buf_notify_chars()`](https://source.chromium.org/chromiumos/chromiumos/codesearch/+/main:src/platform/ec/zephyr/shim/src/console_buffer.c;l\u003d115;drc\u003d686b61c7c2fa3f6706c02a53762ba25f0bf69745) drops whenever [`k_can_yield()`](https://source.chromium.org/chromiumos/chromiumos/codesearch/+/main:src/third_party/zephyrproject/zephyr/kernel/thread.c;l\u003d1897-1901;drc\u003d686b61c7c2fa3f6706c02a53762ba25f0bf69745) returns false, any call entering that branch due to `!k_can_yield()` (including the `!k_can_yield()` path in `log_backend_cros_ec.c` or `PRE_KERNEL` calls when `!shell_is_active()`) will never write to `console_buf` and will only increment `dropped_logs_isr`. And when `CONFIG_LOG_MODE_MINIMAL\u003dy`, `printk_unlocked(\"%s\", buff)` invokes [`zephyr_shim_console_out()`](https://source.chromium.org/chromiumos/chromiumos/codesearch/+/main:src/platform/ec/zephyr/shim/src/console.c;l\u003d322-332;drc\u003d686b61c7c2fa3f6706c02a53762ba25f0bf69745) -\u003e `console_buf_notify_chars(\u0026console_char, 1)` for every byte, incrementing `dropped_logs_isr` once per character.",
